      "section": "QC overview",
      "order": 2,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "The nf-core summary tables, the list of samples that failed mapping, and one panel each for trimming, alignment and coverage. If a sample is going to be a problem, it shows up here. Everything else is folded into the two collapsed sections below, which is also what keeps the first paint cheap: a MultiQC tile only fetches once it scrolls into view, and a tile in a collapsed section never does.",
      "wf_tag": "nextflow/viralrecon"
    },
